zer_V_%22Panther%22.jpg","descriptionUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-H26258,_Panzer_V_%22Panther%22.jpg","width":799,"height":539,"caption":"For documentary purposes the German Federal Archive often retained the original image captions, which may be erroneous, biased, obsolete or politically extreme. Zentralbild, II. Weltkrieg 19139-45\nDer von der faschistischen deutschen Wehrmacht während des Krieges entwickelte neue Panzerkampfwagen Ty","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0 de","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/de/deed.en","attribution":"Unknown authorUnknown author"},{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8d/Bundesarchiv_Bild_101I-722-0406-06A%2C_Frankreich%2C_Panzer_V_%22Panther%22_im_Gel%C3%A4nde.jpg","descriptionUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bundesarchiv_Bild_101I-722-0406-06A,_Frankreich,_Panzer_V_%22Panther%22_im_Gel%C3%A4nde.jpg","width":800,"height":517,"license":"CC BY-SA 3.0 de","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/de/deed.en","attribution":"Theobald"},{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/Bundesarchiv_Bild_101I-478-2167-09%2C_Italien%2C_Panzer_V_%28Panther%29%2C_Panzersoldat.jpg","descriptionUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bundesarchiv_Bild_101I-478-2167-09,_Italien,_Panzer_V_(Panther),_Panzersoldat.jpg","width":512,"height":800,"license":"CC BY-SA 3.0 de","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/de/deed.en","attribution":"Bayer"}],"countries":[{"name":"Nazi Germany","iso3":"DEU"}],"countryCodes":["DEU","FRA","HUN"],"manufacturers":[{"name":"MAN"},{"name":"Daimler-Benz"},{"name":"Maschinenfabrik Niedersachsen-Hannover"}],"designers":[{"name":"MAN AG"}],"operators":[{"name":"Nazi Germany","iso3":"DEU"},{"name":"French Fourth Republic"},{"name":"France","iso3":"FRA"},{"name":"Kingdom of Hungary","iso3":"HUN"},{"name":"Hungary","iso3":"HUN"},{"name":"Limited use by other militaries"}],"conflicts